    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Introduction]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story-driven horror visual novel created with RPG Maker 2003.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Synopsis]</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I happened to run into my little sister's friend. Although she always appeared cheerful, a distinct bruise marred her body.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Just forget it.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Those words keep echoing in my mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>[Game Features]</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story-Driven Horror</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a dark, emotional narrative</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Suspense</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a gripping, suspenseful atmosphere as you unravel the secrets lurking beneath the surface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Retro RPG Maker 2003 Charm</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the classic feel of a traditional RPG Maker horror game.</p></li></ul>",
